{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  BOGO 50% OFFER BLOCK -- "The Pair"
  Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  PLACE IN: Product page, via a Custom Liquid section/block
  (Shrine Pro: Theme Editor > Product template > Add block /
   Add section > Custom Liquid > paste this whole file)

  >>> CRITICAL: THIS BLOCK DOES NOT APPLY THE DISCOUNT. <<<
  It displays the offer and adds 2 jars to the cart.
  The 50%-off-second-jar must be a NATIVE automatic discount:

    Shopify Admin > Discounts > Create discount > Buy X Get Y
      - Title: The Pair (BOGO 50%)
      - Customer buys: Minimum quantity 1 of [Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm]
      - Customer gets: Quantity 1 of [Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm]
                       at 50% off
      - Set "Maximum number of uses per order" so a 2-jar cart
        gets exactly one discounted jar
      - Automatic discount (no code), set Active

  Without that discount live, a 2-jar cart is charged $99.98.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="bogo-pair">
  <div class="bogo-pair__badge">Buy One, Get One 50% Off</div>

  <h3 class="bogo-pair__title">The Pair</h3>
  <p class="bogo-pair__sub">Two jars. One for your face, one for your hands. Or one to keep and one to give.</p>

  <div class="bogo-pair__price">
    <span class="bogo-pair__was">$99.98</span>
    <span class="bogo-pair__now">$74.99</span>
    <span class="bogo-pair__save">You save $24.99</span>
  </div>

  <form method="post" action="/cart/add" class="bogo-pair__form">
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="2">
    <button type="submit" class="bogo-pair__btn">Add Both Jars</button>
  </form>

  <ul class="bogo-pair__trust">
    <li>Free shipping</li>
    <li>60-day guarantee</li>
    <li>4 ingredients</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="bogo-pair__fine">Your second jar comes off at half price automatically at checkout. If your skin doesn't love it in 60 days, email us and we refund every penny.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .bogo-pair{
    max-width:540px;
    margin:24px auto;
    padding:28px 24px;
    background:#FBF6EE;
    border:1px solid #E7D9C3;
    border-radius:14px;
    text-align:center;
    font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
    color:#2E2519;
    box-sizing:border-box;
  }
  .bogo-pair *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  .bogo-pair__badge{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#B8772B;
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:7px 16px;
    border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .bogo-pair__title{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;
    font-size:38px;
    line-height:1.05;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0 0 8px;
    color:#2E2519;
  }
  .bogo-pair__sub{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.5;
    margin:0 auto 20px;
    max-width:380px;
    color:#5A4E3C;
  }
  .bogo-pair__price{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:12px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .bogo-pair__was{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#9B8B73;
    text-decoration:line-through;
  }
  .bogo-pair__now{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:34px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#2E2519;
  }
  .bogo-pair__save{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#B8772B;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
  }
  .bogo-pair__form{margin:0 0 18px;}
  .bogo-pair__btn{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    background:#2E2519;
    color:#FBF6EE;
    border:none;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:16px 20px;
    font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .bogo-pair__btn:hover{background:#B8772B;}
  .bogo-pair__trust{
    list-style:none;
    padding:0;
    margin:0 0 14px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px 18px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#5A4E3C;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .bogo-pair__fine{
    font-size:12.5px;
    line-height:1.5;
    color:#7A6C56;
    margin:0 auto;
    max-width:400px;
  }
  @media (max-width:480px){
    .bogo-pair{padding:24px 18px;}
    .bogo-pair__title{font-size:32px;}
    .bogo-pair__now{font-size:30px;}
  }
</style>
